%% Figure 04 — why-edge-not-epp: fail-closed edge enforcement beats in-pool screening
flowchart LR
    subgraph GOOD["✓ Screening at the edge (NGINX GW Fabric)"]
        direction LR
        A["NGINX GW Fabric"] -->|"pass only"| B["Nova/Laya gate"]
        B --> C["InferencePool/EPP"]
        C --> D["vLLM"]
    end
    subgraph BAD["✗ Screening inside the inference layer"]
        direction LR
        E["Gateway"] --> F["InferencePool"]
